{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0044-kasportsformer-kinematic-anatomy-enhanced-transformer-for.md", "equation": "Transformer: X' = TokenMixer(Norm(X)) + X (Eq. 6); A = softmax(QKᵀ/√d)V (Eq. 7); H^i = α^i_AC ⊙ H^i_AC + α^i_AS ⊙ H^i_AS + α^i_G ⊙ H^i_G (Eq. 9); α_AC = softmax(W_C(H^i_AC)) (Eq. 10).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9122}
